    "                verified directory links — never imported across repos.",
    "  register      NOT set here. It is derived from duration at scan time",
    "                (§14.4): median per creator × topic, shorter = start.",
    "  trusted_hosts global source-list (§14.12b). A creator is scanned from",
    "                their own channel PLUS these, and nowhere else — that is",
    "                what keeps re-uploads and clip channels out without an",
    "                approval gate. A guest video counts for creator X only if X",
    "                is identifiably the speaker AND the topic matches.",
    "  pins          force to the top of a box. blocklist: exclude a video id.",
    "",
    "Rules that outlive this file: link-out only, never rehost, never transcripts."
